            <h2>Engineering experience with a practical, client-first approach.</h2>
            <p>M/S. TULIKA ENTERPRISES was established as a Civil Contractor in 2011. The firm is well established in the construction line, with its registered office in Kharghar.</p>
            <p>The sole owner of the firm is Mr. Dattatray Kamble, who brings practical experience in Civil Engineering. Tulika Enterprises has built a strong reputation and established trust among its clients through qualified staff, experienced engineers and consistent project execution.</p>
            <p>We work across construction, electrical and safety services for industrial projects, delivering total engineering support to improve productivity and reduce cost.</p>
        </div>
